From df045bd2795a37fa127d7a39365a0aae4d6ff1e8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felicitas Pojtinger <felicitas@pojtinger.com>
Date: Fri, 07 Aug 2026 22:28:13 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Add custom icon etc. for Forgejo and document how to re-generate the files

Signed-off-by: Felicitas Pojtinger <felicitas@pojtinger.com>
---
diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 6aa1babf431f6c01a38ac60a042e5508be9206f0..b82bedfd7334833ffa6de56707f38b39df114eeb 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -47,6 +47,18 @@ [setup@vanlug-main ~]$ sudo semodule -DB # To show any denials hidden by `dontaudit` rules
 [setup@vanlug-main ~]$ sudo semodule -B # To re-enable the `dontaudit` rules
 ```
 
+We apply some customizations to Forgejo; to update the icon, follow the [Forgejo "Changing the logo" guidelines](https://forgejo.org/docs/latest/contributor/customization/#changing-the-logo), which involves using the Forgejo repo to generate all the required variants:
+
+```shell
+$ git clone https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo.git
+$ cd forgejo/
+$ # Both the icon and logo of these must be square
+$ curl -sL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vanlug/vanlug.github.io/refs/heads/main/static/design/icon.svg | tee ./assets/favicon.svg ./assets/logo.svg > /dev/null
+$ make generate-images
+$ mkdir -p ../custom/public/assets/img/
+$ cp public/assets/img/{logo.svg,logo.png,avatar_default.png,repo_default.png,apple-touch-icon.png,favicon.svg,favicon.png} ../custom/public/assets/img/
+```
+
